Kadou Floch is a wire-thin, sharp-featured figure of human and elven heritage who moves with an uncanny fluid grace. He favors a dark green coat with synthetic silk and keeps a monocle over his right eye that constantly clicks through its lenses, his fingertips permanently stained amber from his work.

Kadou is a member of [[Org/Alkahest Freight/index|Alkahest Freight]].

He is the one among Alkahest Freight's guests who works out what a [[Phenomena/Keystone|tithe]] asks and what a [[Phenomena/Hearts|heart]] holds. He is no fighter, but he builds magic items, and is working with the Party on a device that finds magic items nearby. He knows the [[Phenomena/Joker World|Joker Worlds]] by name and says a map of the worlds voidward would tell which lie ahead; without one his devices can only say whether an item is near. He will not raid the settlements along the crossing.
